        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Three Cardinals</strong> is a short, nonlinear exploration game with rhythm-based character movement. You play as Mother Cardinal and explore 3 distinct regions to find your chicks who all recently moved out of the family nest…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> scenic landscapes inspired by Quebec’s wilderness: from the Northern Cliffs’ golden woods to the Eastern Bay’s rocky beaches…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLY AND SING</strong> using simple controls. Feel like going a little faster? As you fly, press “Space Bar” to the music’s melody and boost your speed! Later, upgrade this ability by finding each of the three cardinals' instruments…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong> with over 50 unique characters! Whether you’re looking to test your flying skills in a race with Jé, the blue jay, or crack the case on the Eastern Bay’s latest mystery with Sullivan, the snowy owl, there’s always a new friend around the corner to speak to…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong> and use them to craft new furniture for your chicks when they come back home! A couple pebbles and twigs could be used to make a pebble-bath and branch-couch… or maybe you could even find a stranger willing to exchange these materials for a pet bumblebee!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Three Cardinals</strong> is a short, nonlinear exploration game with rhythm-based character movement. You play as Mother Cardinal and explore 3 distinct regions to find your chicks who all recently moved out of the family nest…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/a9aba727b481c78c6e58d5949d36fb46.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLORE</strong> scenic landscapes inspired by Quebec’s wilderness: from the Northern Cliffs’ golden woods to the Eastern Bay’s rocky beaches…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/52270d67ac5c4f7ec39935f23d8c02b8.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLY AND SING</strong> using simple controls. Feel like going a little faster? As you fly, press “Space Bar” to the music’s melody and boost your speed! Later, upgrade this ability by finding each of the three cardinals' instruments…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/65248a67716364004fad3b44398d26f4.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MAKE FRIENDS</strong> with over 50 unique characters! Whether you’re looking to test your flying skills in a race with Jé, the blue jay, or crack the case on the Eastern Bay’s latest mystery with Sullivan, the snowy owl, there’s always a new friend around the corner to speak to…</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.poster.avif?t=1760616007\" width=608 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.webm?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865990/extras/711ceccdcd1d77f70e9af2b1f402734c.mp4?t=1760616007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLLECT ITEMS</strong> and use them to craft new furniture for your chicks when they come back home! A couple pebbles and twigs could be used to make a pebble-bath and branch-couch… or maybe you could even find a stranger willing to exchange these materials for a pet bumblebee!</p></li></ul>",
